* SG13CMOS5L capacitor tests. This is a real file rather than the symlink into
* SG13G2 the other test directories use: cap_cmomf has no SG13G2 counterpart,
* so its OSDI is not in the shared init and a symlinked .spiceinit would leave
* tb_cap_cmomf_typ.sp with no model.
setcs sourcepath = ( $sourcepath $PDK_ROOT/$PDK/libs.tech/ngspice/models )
osdi  '$PDK_ROOT/$PDK/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/cap_cmomi.osdi'
osdi  '$PDK_ROOT/$PDK/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/cap_cmomf.osdi'

* printout suppression to improve performance
option noacct nomod
